"Renir, the Pillar of Lost Magic, is sealed alive in an amber gem by the Night Order."
"The gem bears nine seals; each broken seal gives back a little of his magic."
"Renir hunted dark mages nearly out; with him gone they walk freely again."
"Forestwind Mage Academy, which infuses students at its wind node, is linked to the Night Order."
"Navaterian sigilcraft, of an extinct insectkin race, is a system even Renir does not know."
